  {
   "id": "t1825625670",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 530,
   "width": 1046.65,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1440887284,
   "versionNonce": 284719590,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Both mechanisms produce the correct answer. The difference is what happens to a thread that loses the race: a mutex puts it to sleep, a strand gives it something else to do.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Both mechanisms produce the correct answer. The difference is what happens to a thread that loses the race: a mutex puts it to sleep, a strand gives it something else to do.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1460252226",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 554,
   "width": 834.9000000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1416745792,
   "versionNonce": 695971041,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Futex counts measured with ch51's method (strace -f -c -e trace=futex). Gated as a ratio, never as magnitudes \u2014 they move with scheduling.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Futex counts measured with ch51's method (strace -f -c -e trace=futex). Gated as a ratio, never as magnitudes \u2014 they move with scheduling.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1510891633",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 578,
   "width": 1022.45,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 89626194,
   "versionNonce": 1617888104,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A strand costs no lock and no thread. What it costs instead is ordering: handlers on one strand can never run in parallel with each other, however many threads you have.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A strand costs no lock and no thread. What it costs instead is ordering: handlers on one strand can never run in parallel with each other, however many threads you have.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
